Cycle 4 day 1 modified FOLFOX for colon adenocarcinoma. ANC 2.4 K/uL, platelets 188 K/uL, hemoglobin 10.2 g/dL, creatinine 0.9 mg/dL, total bilirubin 0.7 mg/dL. Oxaliplatin, leucovorin, and fluorouracil administered through implanted port serial: {{device}}. No infusion reaction.

