Focal epilepsy with impaired awareness. No seizures for eight months. Neurologic examination shows fluent speech, symmetric facial movement, full strength, and normal gait. Continue levetiracetam 750 mg twice daily. EEG showed left temporal sharp waves; brain MRI showed no structural lesion. Driving precautions reviewed.

