Methicillin-sensitive Staphylococcus aureus bacteremia associated with a removed peripheral catheter. Repeat blood cultures are negative. Transthoracic echocardiogram shows no vegetation. Continue cefazolin 2 g IV every 8 hours through the planned stop date. WBC 7.4 K/uL, creatinine 0.8 mg/dL, ALT 24 U/L. Monitor weekly CBC and CMP.
